From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 46/46] office layer: version snapshot on save, office.history
 and the XDFU watermark

PLAN WP10/WP11 for Sheets, on the 0141 hook. The hook gains `wrap` (default: run the command), the engine gains
`register_command` (a command found by id but not listed), and the new ui-egui/src/office_history.rs (desktop only,
installed from main) fills them: a snapshot after file.save/file.saveAs of the document's own file (autosave at most
every 5 minutes per file), the `office.history` command, and with xdfu = on the watermark of every copy of a grif
workbook (print, PDF/CSV/HTML export, save as, file.saveBytes) with the copy number from the audit chain, plus
`office.xdfu.insertGrif`. Nothing is refused. With xdfu off nothing XDFU exists. Autosave passes `autosave: true`.
---
